  "description": "API 1.47 (contracts/README.md, Rules and Memory per run). `expressions`: the one expression language of `when`, rules and peak_gb formulas, evaluated over `values` (a name not in them resolves to nothing: \"error\"). `cases`: a canonical workflow of `families`, its params filled (schema defaults, the workflow's values, then `inputs`): `errors` = every rule that holds (check.py rule_errors: node id order, then param order, an item field's per item; studio answers the first as its 422, the form shows each under its param); `peak_gb` = the run's own planned peak (check.py run_peak: the largest of its nodes' peak_gb formulas over the node's params, mp and frames).",
